.TH PROFESS 1
.SH NAME
profess \- take a name
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B profess
.I NAME
.SH DESCRIPTION
Takes
.IR NAME .
The cell moves to
.RI /cloister/ NAME .
.PP
.I NAME
is 2 to 24 characters: lowercase letters, digits, hyphens. It begins with a letter. A name is held once.
.PP
Requires a key at
.IR ~/.ssh/id_ed25519 .
.SH SEE ALSO
ssh-keygen(1), ordeal(1)
